STATEMENT: >>>
Where a SAMPLE product with digital elements is exposed to the EU marketplace,

SAMPLE shall expose said product accompanied by the single point of contact where information about vulnerabilities of the product with digital elements can be reported and received.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This only is required of products exposed to the EU marketplace.
<<<
